	"data": "🎙️ Audio Journal — Sep 18, 2026 (8:11 AM, driving to work)\n\nDuration: ~30 min | Context: Driving to work, day before Renaissance Fair\n\nRenaissance Fair Prep\nKatie and I have the renaissance fair tomorrow. Katie's been working very hard on our outfits — very neutral for her. Driving to work now, will do best while there but want to use this drive to think through what I want to work on.\n\nSetting Up for Success\nI put myself in position of working on Thought Bubbles and wanting to enter a Thought…",
